+# required. Each check reads only its own lines, fails on a malformed line
+# of either kind, and fails on a waiver of its own that matched nothing,
+# so an entry cannot outlive what it excuses. ci/harbour-waivers.sh is the
+# one parser; docs/HARBOUR.md has the policy.
